>> Combination := Uluhlu entsha.

Combination xa-kufika: ['yongeza-ekugqibeleni:'] yenza: { :el
	ngokwakho 
	fumana: el, Engenanto? inyaniso: { ngokwakho yongeza-ekugqibeleni: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination entsha.
colours
	yongeza-ekugqibeleni: ['red'],
	yongeza-ekugqibeleni: ['green'],
	yongeza-ekugqibeleni: ['blue'],
	yongeza-ekugqibeleni: ['red'].

Imveliso bhala: colours, umgca-omtsha.
